Respect My Trims for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Respect My Trims 1.4.0 by N (tnoctua).
Original source: https://github.com/tnoctua/respectmytrims
Original licence: LGPL-2.1-only

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included); the icon is the original's. This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-2.1-only); the licence text is in LICENSE.
